          "intent": "Get Kael fired and force him to look at his ignored System notifications.",
          "section_role": "setup",
          "target_scene_count": 1,
          "end_condition": "Kael is alone at the dungeon entrance with the Patch Notes interface open.",
          "scenes": [
            {
              "scene_id": 1,
              "summary": "Kael gets jump-scared by a Cave Spider (Lvl 2) and drops a `[Minor Health Potion]`. Brog, the meathead leader of the Crimson Vultures, screams at him, docks his non-existent pay, and boots him from the party right at the entrance of the Mud-Tooth Grotto. Left with 30/30 HP, a half-eaten piece of `[Tough Jerky]`, and zero combat skills, Kael uses his `[Adventurer's Guild Scribe's Manual]` as kindling to avoid freezing. Staring at the pathetic fire, he finally opens a blinking System Notification he's ignored since Level 1: `[System Notification: Passive Skill Unlocked at Class Inception] - [Review Patch Notes]`. He opens the read-only interface to find a wall of developer gibberish and nerf complaints.",
              "type": "setup",
              "goal": "Survive the firing and find a way to stay warm.",
              "conflict": "Brog's temper and Kael's absolute lack of combat stats.",
              "outcome": "Kael is fired, burns his manual, and unlocks his unique System access.",
